OL,3,GNEWSABarrister jailed over revenge plot
OL,4,Awith client
OL,5,
OL,6,FA barrister from West Yorkshire who
OL,7,Fplotted a revenge attack with her
OL,8,F"career criminal" client has been
OL,9,Fjailed for more than three years.
OL,11,FSamreen Akhtar had represented Tabish
OL,12,FAli, who had been shot and injured in
OL,13,FBlacker Road in Huddersfield on 14
OL,14,FSeptember 2021.
