OL,3,GNEWSABarrister jailed over revenge plot
OL,4,Awith client
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe following day, the 38-year-old
OL,7,Fbarrister, of Sufton Street,
OL,8,FHuddersfield, was recorded on a
OL,9,Ftelephone call to Ali putting forward a
OL,10,Fplan to find the person responsible for
OL,11,Fthe shooting so they could be caused
OL,12,Fserious injuries, according to West
OL,13,FYorkshire Police.
OL,15,FAkhtar was convicted of encouraging or
OL,16,Fassisting the commission of an
OL,17,Findictable offence, namely inflicting
OL,18,Fgrievous bodily harm with intent.
